  "preamble": "The shift from the open central/back vowel [a] to the near-open front vowel [æ] is a common historical process known as fronting or palatalization. It frequently occurs when influenced by surrounding palatal consonants or through broad systemic vowel shifts.",
  "phoneticEffects": "Fronting, Palatalization, Anglo-Frisian Brightening, Imala, Umlaut",
  "languageExamples": [
    {
      "language": "Finnish (Vowel Harmony)",
      "languageFamily": "Uralic",
      "examples": [
        {
          "from": "a (back vowel root)",
          "to": "ä [æ] (front harmony suffix)",
          "note": "Finnish vowel harmony: roots with /a, o, u/ use back-vowel suffixes (-ssa, -lla), while roots with /ä, ö, y/ use front-vowel suffixes (-ssä, -llä). The a↔ä alternation is grammatically productive."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "language": "Old English",
      "languageFamily": "Germanic",
      "examples": [
        {
          "from": "dagaz (Proto-Germanic)",
          "to": "dæg [æ]",
          "note": "Anglo-Frisian Brightening: Proto-Germanic short [a] shifted to [æ]."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "language": "Arabic",
      "languageFamily": "Semitic",
      "examples": [
        {
          "from": "bāb [a:]",
          "to": "bæb [æ:]",
          "note": "Imala: The 'leaning' of the open vowel toward a fronted quality in certain dialects."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "language": "Proto-Slavic",
      "languageFamily": "Slavic",
      "examples": [
        {
          "from": "*polja",
          "to": "poljæ",
          "note": "Vowel Synharmonism: Fronting of the back vowel after a palatal consonant."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "language": "Inari Sami",
      "languageFamily": "Samic",
      "examples": [
        {
          "from": "Proto-Samic *ājmē 'needle'",
          "to": "äimi [æ]",
          "note": "Umlaut: Proto-Samic first-syllable *ā was fronted to ä /æ/ before a second-syllable *ē, but stays á before *ā, *ō and gives a before *ë (Northern Sami áibmi keeps á)."
        },
        {
          "from": "Proto-Samic *sāppē 'gall'",
